# PostHog Terraform root local files.
#
# Per ADR-0020 this root does not have an env/<env>.tfvars directory —
# per-environment values come from config/environments/<env>.xcconfig and the
# matching GitHub Environment. The provider lock file (.terraform.lock.hcl)
# is intentionally committed (see PR #56) so CI and local dev validate against
# identical provider versions and hashes.

.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
backend/*.hcl
!backend/*.hcl.example
